"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0},{"items":[],"id":16352,"title":"فضيلة خانم وبناتها","description":"","card_type":"normalPoster","type":"SERIES","url":"","style":{"image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk59/shows/963b2cae-fefd-4c9e-bc11-d7f9d4d5b715.jpg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Related","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":17457,"title":"","description":"12","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama"],"id":17457,"type":"SERIES","title":"عودة مهند","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk55/seasons/115a2c46-9697-4ec2-9f64-755c73917c0b.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk46/seasons/10cb0fe6-d750-4f89-8043-601c780ab53b.jpg","likes":171,"dislikes":7,"views":78508,"release_date":"1315353600000","season_number":1,"description":"Kuzey and Güney are brothers, yet they cannot be more different, both in character and also in their perception, much like their names they are north and south. While the older brother Güney strives in school and is the general good boy next door, his younger brother is nothing like him, he is wild and unpredictable. Despite their differences, the disparate brothers still fall in love with the same girl, Cemre, who has just moved into the neighbourhood. When Cemre and Güney get together, Kuzey is devastated. An unfortunate event leads to a car accident where a man dies. Even though Güney drove the car that causes the death of a man, Kuzey takes the blame on himself and goes to prison for hit-and-run. After three years, he is released from prison and returns to his family.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.5}],"value":7.5,"age":"TV-14"},"current_season_id":5509,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}